      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Outbound: dial customers\nEvery minute: read the queue, keep rows with permission = Yes, status = Pending and a due time.\nEach row: **Dialing** (so it is never dialed twice) -> start the Dograh call -> log the attempt -> **Initiated**.\nIf Dograh refuses the call: **Failed**.",
          "height": 260,
          "width": 1900,
          "color": 5
        },
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          -2720,
